  "custom_logic_notes": "Entry requires BOTH a new ZigZag point AND EMA trend alignment on the previous bar. The ZigZag buffer reading skips the 5 most recent bars to avoid unfixed/repointing ZigZag values. Fibonacci 57% retracement level is used as the pending order entry price (non-standard Fib level). Pending orders have a lifecycle: placed once per signal, then deleted after WaitNewSignalZigZagBarCount bars if unfilled, then the EA resets to accept new signals. The position_gate check uses PositionSelect(_Symbol) which only allows one position per symbol regardless of magic number. Order placement also blocked by orderSudahDipasang flag until lifecycle resets.",
